    "long_instructions": "## Get Peer Feedback\r\n\r\nGive and receive feedback on your app. Use your [Peer Feedback (TAG) handout](https://docs.google.com/document/d/196A_CX_4jCVIst6yXn_-_SZiWPM3budE1Yel8eemvRA/edit?usp=sharing) to guide and record your feedback.\r\n\r\n1. Share your app with a partner.  \r\n2. Review your partner's app and have them review yours.  \r\n3. Use the TAG method (Tell, Ask, Give) to provide feedback.\r\n",
